@def MICRO_OS_PLUS_UTILS_LISTS_TRACE_CONSTRUCTORS_ENABLED
@brief Enable the trace calls for the µOS++ C++ Intrusive Lists constructors.

@details
The macro is intended to be defined by the user, 
typically in 
the library's own
`micro-os-plus/utils/lists-defines.h` configuration file or the 
project `micro-os-plus/project-config.h` configuration file.

When `MICRO_OS_PLUS_UTILS_LISTS_TRACE_CONSTRUCTORS_ENABLED` is defined, 
class constructors and destructors include a `trace::printf()` call with the 
address of the current object.
